<title>FRANCE: French defence minister to visit Israel -aides.</title>
<headline>French defence minister to visit Israel -aides.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Defence Minister Charles Millon will pay an official visit to Israel in January or February, his office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The visit was initially due to take place in July but was postponed. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
